    {
      "source": "You can create an instance of <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/core/RedisTemplate.html\">RedisTemplate</a></code> (or <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/core/ReactiveRedisTemplate.html\">ReactiveRedisTemplate</a></code>for reactive usage) with a <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\">RedisConnectionFactory</a></code>. Connection factories are an abstraction on top of the supported drivers.",
      "translation": "您可以使用 <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/core/RedisTemplate.html\">RedisTemplate</a></code>（或用于响应式使用的 <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/core/ReactiveRedisTemplate.html\">ReactiveRedisTemplate</a></code>）创建一个实例，并配合使用 <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/RedisConnectionFactory.html\">RedisConnectionFactory</a></code>。连接工厂是对支持驱动程序的抽象封装。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "An easy way to bootstrap setting up a working environment is to create a Spring-based project via <a href=\"https://start.spring.io/#!type=maven-project&amp;dependencies=data-redis\">start.spring.io</a> or create a Spring project in <a href=\"https://spring.io/tools\">Spring Tools</a>.",
      "translation": "一种简单的方法是通过<a href=\"https://start.spring.io/#!type=maven-project&amp;dependencies=data-redis\">start.spring.io</a>创建基于 Spring 的项目，或者在<a href=\"https://spring.io/tools\">Spring Tools</a>中创建 Spring 项目，以快速搭建可运行的开发环境。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "First, you need to set up a running Redis server.\nSpring Data Redis requires Redis 2.6 or above and Spring Data Redis integrates with <a href=\"https://github.com/lettuce-io/lettuce-core\">Lettuce</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/redis/jedis\">Jedis</a>, two popular open-source Java libraries for Redis.",
      "translation": "首先，您需要启动一个 Redis 服务器。  \nSpring Data Redis 需要 Redis 2.6 或更高版本，并且它集成了 <a href=\"https://github.com/lettuce-io/lettuce-core\">Lettuce</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/redis/jedis\">Jedis</a>，这两款是流行的开源 Java Redis 库。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The GitHub <a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-examples\">spring-data-examples repository</a> hosts several examples that you can download and play around with to get a feel for how the library works.",
      "translation": "GitHub 上的<a href=\"https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-data-examples\">spring-data-examples 仓库</a>托管了多个示例，您可以下载并尝试运行这些示例，以了解该库的工作原理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Now you can create a simple Java application that stores and reads a value to and from Redis.",
      "translation": "现在，您可以创建一个简单的 Java 应用程序，用于将值存储到 Redis 中并从其中读取。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create the main application to run, as the following example shows:",
      "translation": "创建主应用程序以运行，如下例所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Even in this simple example, there are a few notable things to point out:",
      "translation": "即使在这个简单的例子中，也有几点值得指出：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "There’s no single way to use Redis as it comes with support for a wide range of data structures such as plain keys (\"strings\"), lists, sets, sorted sets, streams, hashes and so on.",
      "translation": "Redis 的使用方式并非只有一种，因为它支持多种数据结构，包括普通键（\"字符串\"）、列表、集合、有序集合、流、哈希等。",
      "count": 1
    },
